// A shot changes more than the lyric layout: each visual family exposes a
// different lens on its own background. These are static compositor-friendly
// poses (transform + transition), so switching a line does not start another
// animation loop or repaint the full stage.
// Templates own their foreground motion vocabulary.  Every line receives a
// deterministic variation of its selected template so the stage is not only a
// recoloured version of the same kinetic treatment.
